{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31256094\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究直接评估了帕金森病患者FOG及其对物理治疗的反应，可作为FOG临床表型和非神经调控干预的间接参考，但未涉及STN活动或DBS。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31257656\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述涉及纹状体神经活动、皮质纹状体信息处理及多巴胺-谷氨酸相互作用，可为基底节网络竞争性机制提供背景，但未直接讨论STN或FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31258617\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要综述肉毒毒素治疗运动障碍，与STN神经活动及帕金森病FOG机制无直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31267577\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究胶质细胞α-突触核蛋白在果蝇神经退行性病变中的作用，未涉及STN、DBS或FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31272926\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接在PD-FOG患者中比较STN与SNr刺激对预期姿势调整的影响，发现STN刺激未显著调节APA而SNr刺激产生调节效应，是分析STN与FOG因果关系及竞争性机制的重要原始证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31275542\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究PD-FOG患者的动作序列效应及SMA刺激，发现FOG改善并非通过改善序列效应实现，可作为皮质运动控制机制与STN机制的交叉比较证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31282427\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述主要讨论PD的性别差异及疾病进展，没有涉及STN神经活动或FOG相关机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31286057\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者视觉皮层增益控制及视觉诱发电位异常，未直接涉及FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31286519\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究七鳃鳗嗅觉诱发运动输出的多巴胺调节，与PD、STN及FOG研究问题无直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31286974\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统综述和荟萃分析评估tDCS对PD功能性行走的影响，但未具体研究FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31293379\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要研究PD患者的音乐体验和音乐参与度，与STN神经活动及FOG机制无直接关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31293511\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究长期STN-DBS患者刺激开关状态对运动及轴性症状的急性影响，可提供STN调控与步态相关症状的临床证据，但摘要未明确报告FOG或STN神经记录。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31300001\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要研究PD患者非稳态行走中的动态平衡评估和机器学习预测，没有涉及FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31301412\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究迷走神经刺激通过TrkB发挥PD动物模型中的神经保护作用，与STN-FOG关系无直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31304341\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要研究可穿戴传感器对PD震颤和运动迟缓的检测，与FOG及STN神经活动无直接关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31308799\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究tau转基因小鼠的步态启动障碍及脑干病理，但并非PD模型，也未涉及STN或FOG神经生理机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31314744\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究MPTP小鼠前额叶GABA能传递及步态异常，未直接涉及FOG或STN活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31314869\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要综述CBD治疗PD的潜在神经保护作用，没有针对STN神经活动或FOG的分析。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31315608\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究早期PD的纵向生物标志物及疾病进展，与STN神经活动和FOG的具体关系无直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31315679\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述tDCS运动康复的不同刺激靶点及机制，未针对PD冻结步态或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31316371\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者步态适应性与执行功能、反应性平衡的关系，可为FOG的非STN认知及姿势控制机制提供间接参考，但未直接评估FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31317505\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要研究肠道微生物、炎症及细胞治疗在PD动物模型中的作用，与STN神经活动及FOG无直接关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31323240\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究秀丽隐杆线虫多巴胺缺陷及运动行为检测方法，与人类PD的STN活动和FOG机制无直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31324539\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD模型中纹状体胆碱能中间神经元与多巴胺相互作用，可为基底节内非STN神经递质机制提供交叉证据，但未直接研究FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31330231\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较PD冻结者与非冻结者转身时的前额叶活动，发现FOG患者前额叶活动升高且与FOG严重程度相关，可作为皮质代偿或认知控制机制与STN机制的竞争性解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31330813\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述DBS术中侵入性神经记录及其对人类神经环路功能的研究价值，可为STN神经记录的研究方法和机制解释提供背景，但摘要未具体讨论FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31330885\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究五味子提取物对MPTP小鼠多巴胺能神经元及运动功能的保护作用，没有涉及STN神经活动或FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31337067\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者转身时的步态异常，而转身是FOG的重要诱发情境，可为FOG任务设计及运动学表型比较提供间接参考，但没有神经记录或冻结者分组分析。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31337633\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"病例报告揭示左旋多巴剂量相关的矛盾性FOG及姿势不稳，可用于讨论多巴胺状态、FOG亚型和STN活动之间关系的潜在混杂因素。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:31344030\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者吞咽障碍与突触前多巴胺能功能的关系，主要涉及吞咽功能而非STN神经活动或FOG。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "03f82877-b5e0-4f2c-a1f1-fe1438396ce1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T143323169140Z", "elapsed_seconds": 171.704, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T14:36:14.882993+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "63e3c871478f4b0f3ae19358c689df207d242a206a758b962fe88ae71f140261", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T143323169140Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "bde6a032477d890c4c85eea7a6290809f1520cd6f8e6db31b2b8967b46fa27b7"}}}
